<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN"><head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0">
<title>AI4S 科研赋能工具箱 · 探索科学的未知疆域</title>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
:root{
  --navy:#0a2540;--navy2:#1665aa;--cyan:#38bdf8;--teal:#2dd4bf;--gold:#fbbf24;
  --ink:#0f172a;--sub:#64748c;--line:#e2e8f0;--bg:#f8fafc;
}
body{font-family:-apple-system,"PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);background:var(--navy);line-height:1.6}
.wrap{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}

/* ===== Hero: 火箭发射视频背景 ===== */
.hero{position:relative;min-height:92vh;display:flex;align-items:center;overflow:hidden}
.hero-video{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;z-index:0}
.hero-veil{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:1;
  background:linear-gradient(100deg,rgba(6,20,40,.55) 0%,rgba(6,20,40,.18) 40%,rgba(6,20,40,0) 65%,rgba(6,20,40,.22) 100%),
             linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(6,20,40,.15) 0%,rgba(6,20,40,0) 40%,rgba(6,20,40,.5) 100%);}
.hero-grid{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:1;
  background-image:radial-gradient(rgba(56,189,248,.08) 1px,transparent 1px);
  background-size:34px 34px;opacity:.6}
/* 科研元素浮动 */
.hero-sci{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:2;pointer-events:none;overflow:hidden}
.sci-el{position:absolute;color:rgba(125,211,252,.15);font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;animation:float 15s ease-in-out infinite}
.sci-el.f{font-size:15px;letter-spacing:1px}
.sci-el.n{font-size:13px;color:rgba(45,212,191,.13)}
.sci-el.h{font-size:19px;color:rgba(251,191,36,.12)}
@keyframes float{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0) rotate(-2deg)}50%{transform:translateY(-24px) rotate(2deg)}}
.hero-inner{position:relative;z-index:4;padding:90px 0}
.hero-kicker{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;
  background:rgba(56,189,248,.12);border:1px solid rgba(56,189,248,.32);
  color:#7dd3fc;padding:7px 18px;border-radius:24px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:26px;backdrop-filter:blur(4px)}
.hero-kicker .dot{width:7px;height:7px;background:var(--teal);border-radius:50%;animation:pulse 2s infinite}
@keyframes pulse{0%,100%{opacity:1}50%{opacity:.3}}
.hero h1{font-size:58px;line-height:1.13;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin-bottom:6px;letter-spacing:-1px;text-shadow:0 4px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.4)}
.hero h1 .accent{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#38bdf8,#2dd4bf,#fbbf24);
  -webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}
.hero .en{font-size:15px;color:#7dd3fc;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:4px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:22px;opacity:.92}
.hero p{font-size:18px;color:#dbe4f0;max-width:620px;margin-bottom:36px;line-height:1.7;text-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}
.hero-cta{display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center}
.btn-primary{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1665aa,#0d9488);color:#fff;padding:15px 36px;border-radius:12px;
  font-weight:700;font-size:16px;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 8px 26px rgba(13,148,136,.4);transition:.2s;display:inline-block}
.btn-primary:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 12px 34px rgba(13,148,136,.55)}
.btn-ghost{color:#e2e8f0;border:1.5px solid rgba(226,232,240,.4);padding:13px 30px;border-radius:12px;
  font-weight:600;font-size:15px;text-decoration:none;transition:.2s;backdrop-filter:blur(4px)}
.btn-ghost:hover{border-color:#7dd3fc;color:#7dd3fc}
.hero-stats{display:flex;gap:36px;margin-top:52px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.hero-stats div{color:#a5b4c9;font-size:13px;text-shadow:0 1px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}
.hero-stats b{display:block;font-size:30px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;letter-spacing:-.5px}
.hero-stats .hl{color:var(--gold)}
.scroll-hint{position:absolute;bottom:26px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);z-index:4;
  color:#7dd3fc;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;animation:bob 2s infinite}
@keyframes bob{0%,100%{transform:translate(-50%,0)}50%{transform:translate(-50%,8px)}}

/* ===== 导航区 ===== */
.nav-sec{position:relative;padding:72px 0 80px;overflow:hidden}
.nav-video{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;z-index:0}
.nav-veil{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:1;
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(7,24,46,.88) 0%,rgba(10,37,64,.80) 50%,rgba(7,24,46,.88) 100%)}
.nav-sec .wrap{position:relative;z-index:2}
.sec-head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:46px}
.sec-head .en{font-size:13px;color:#38bdf8;letter-spacing:4px;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:10px}
.sec-head h2{font-size:32px;font-weight:800;color:#fff}
.sec-head p{color:#94a3b8;font-size:15px;margin-top:8px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:18px}
.card{position:relative;background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid rgba(148,163,184,.16);
  border-radius:16px;padding:26px;text-decoration:none;color:#e2e8f0;transition:.22s;display:block;backdrop-filter:blur(6px);overflow:hidden}
.card::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--c,transparent) 0%,transparent 40%);opacity:0;transition:.22s}
.card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);border-color:var(--c);box-shadow:0 14px 34px rgba(0,0,0,.4)}
.card:hover::before{opacity:.08}
.card .ic{font-size:34px;margin-bottom:14px;position:relative}
.card .en{font-size:11px;color:var(--c);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:6px;position:relative}
.card h3{font-size:19px;margin-bottom:6px;color:#fff;position:relative}
.card p{font-size:13px;color:#94a3b8;line-height:1.5;position:relative}
.card .go{margin-top:14px;font-size:13px;color:var(--c);font-weight:700;position:relative}
.card.hot::after{content:"主推";position:absolute;top:16px;right:16px;background:var(--c);color:#04263b;
  font-size:11px;font-weight:800;padding:3px 11px;border-radius:12px;z-index:2}
footer{background:#050f1d;padding:32px 0;text-align:center}
footer .links{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:22px;flex-wrap:wrap}
footer a{color:#64748b;font-size:13px;text-decoration:none;transition:.15s}
footer a:hover{color:#38bdf8}
@media(max-width:640px){.hero h1{font-size:36px}.hero{min-height:80vh}.hero-stats{gap:22px}}
</style></head><body>

<header class="hero">
  <video class="hero-video" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="assets/img/sail.png">
    <source src="assets/img/rocket.mp4" type="video/mp4">
  </video>
  <div class="hero-veil"></div>
  <div class="hero-grid"></div>
  <div class="hero-sci">
    <span class="sci-el f" style="top:12%;left:6%">E = mc²</span>
    <span class="sci-el f" style="top:20%;right:9%;animation-delay:2s">ΔG = ΔH − TΔS</span>
    <span class="sci-el n" style="top:36%;left:11%;animation-delay:4s">ATCG·GCTA·1101</span>
    <span class="sci-el f" style="top:54%;right:6%;animation-delay:1s">ψ(x,t) = Ae^(iκx−iωt)</span>
    <span class="sci-el h" style="top:70%;left:7%;animation-delay:3s">⬡ C₆H₁₂O₆</span>
    <span class="sci-el n" style="top:80%;right:13%;animation-delay:5s">α-helix · β-sheet</span>
    <span class="sci-el f" style="top:28%;left:46%;animation-delay:2.5s">∇²φ = 0</span>
    <span class="sci-el n" style="top:15%;left:62%;animation-delay:3.5s">p &lt; 0.05 ✓</span>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-inner wrap">
    <h1>探索科学的<span class="accent">未知疆域</span><br>让 AI 成为你科研的远航之帆</h1>
    <div class="en">Beyond Horizons · Embrace the Journey</div>
    <p>面向科学家 / 教授 / 高校教师 —— 政策经费匹配 · 能力诊断 · 137+ 平台工具 · 131 开源技能 · 10 门课程，一站式打通 AI4S 落地路径。</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a class="btn-primary" href="#nav">开始探索 →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-stats">
      <div><b>137</b>平台工具·模型</div>
      <div><b>131</b>开源科研技能</div>
      <div><b>10</b>门课程卡片</div>
      <div><b class="hl">4000万</b>单项最高补贴</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="scroll-hint">SCROLL ▾</div>
</header>

<section class="nav-sec" id="nav">
  <video class="nav-video" autoplay muted loop playsinline>
    <source src="assets/img/sail.mp4" type="video/mp4">
  </video>
  <div class="nav-veil"></div>
  <div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head">
    <div class="en">Navigate Your Research</div>
    <h2>选择你的科研航道</h2>
    <p>六大学科垂直工具箱 + 科研技能包，总有一条适合你</p>
  </div>
  <div class="grid">
    <a class="card" style="--c:#2dd4bf" href="life.html">
      <div class="ic">🧬</div><div class="en">Life Science</div><h3>生命科学</h3>
      <p>蛋白质工程 · 药物发现 · 基因组学 · 医学影像 —— 58 项资产，45 个垂类模型</p>
      <div class="go">启航 →</div>
    </a>
    <a class="card" style="--c:#f59e0b" href="material.html">
      <div class="ic">⚛️</div><div class="en">Material Science</div><h3>物质科学</h3>
      <p>计算化学 · 新材料发现 · 结构解析 —— 33 项资产，材料研发从试错到数据驱动</p>
      <div class="go">启航 →</div>
    </a>
    <a class="card" style="--c:#60a5fa" href="engineering.html">
      <div class="ic">⚙️</div><div class="en">Engineering</div><h3>工程技术</h3>
      <p>光学设计 · 工业优化 · 湿实验自动化 —— 叠加 4000 万算力补贴</p>
      <div class="go">启航 →</div>
    </a>
    <a class="card" style="--c:#38bdf8" href="earth.html">
      <div class="ic">🌍</div><div class="en">Earth & Environment</div><h3>地球环境</h3>
      <p>气象预测 · 海洋计算 · 地震监测 —— 伏羲气象大模型 + 专业工具链</p>
      <div class="go">启航 →</div>
    </a>
    <a class="card" style="--c:#a78bfa" href="math.html">
      <div class="ic">🔢</div><div class="en">Math & Quantum</div><h3>数学量子</h3>
      <p>数学推理 · 优化求解 · 高性能计算 —— Abel 模型 + CAML 国产算子库</p>
      <div class="go">启航 →</div>
    </a>
    <a class="card" style="--c:#f472b6" href="cross.html">
      <div class="ic">🔀</div><div class="en">Interdisciplinary</div><h3>交叉学科</h3>
      <p>社科问卷 · 语音文本 · 化学交叉大模型 —— 通用 AI 能力下沉每个学科</p>
      <div class="go">启航 →</div>
    </a>
    <a class="card" style="--c:#14b8a6" href="skills.html">
      <div class="ic">🧰</div><div class="en">Skill Pack</div><h3>科研技能包</h3>
      <p>真实好用的 AI 工具 —— 三大开源项目精选 131 技能，装进 Claude Code 即用</p>
      <div class="go">启航 →</div>
    </a>
  </div>
</div></section>

<footer>
</footer>

</body></html>
